Bind Npc 31556 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31555 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 642 "Labor Shortage"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Captain] Pasha."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Captain] Redin."

Requires player level >= 61

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "There are people who have sailed from afar at the Port Pugative.  What's going on?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "There are people who have sailed from afar at the Port Hashak.  What's going on?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How do you do? I am Pasha, the [captain] of this merchant vessel."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I've come from a long distance to exchange various specialty products.\n\nLet's see ... You look pretty strong. I need a hand. Can you help us?\n\nIt should be a conversation with the Captain Pasha of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How do you do? I am Reddin, the [captain] of this merchant vessel."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I've come from a long distance to exchange various specialty products.\n\nLet's see ... You look pretty strong. I need a hand. Can you help us?\n\nIt should be a conversation with the Captain of the Sharks port Aladdin and El Morad area."

On claimable
    Show quest "Hahaha, so you are a broad-minded fellow! Good! First, get me [Adonis Specialty Honey] from [Hornet]! I heard it's very precious so how could I not want it? Hahaha!"
